sequenceDiagram
    actor NOC as NOC
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant BE as Backend
    participant DB as Database

    Note over NOC,DB: HKN-002, HKN-003, HKN-004: Manajemen Perangkat Jaringan

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note right of NOC: HKN-002: Menambah Data Perangkat
        NOC->>FE: Input data perangkat<br/>(IP, jenis, mitra)
        activate FE
        FE->>BE: POST /api/devices
        activate BE
        BE->>DB: Insert data perangkat
        activate DB
        DB-->>BE: Return device_id
        deactivate DB
        FE-->>NOC: Tampilkan perangkat baru
        deactivate BE
        deactivate FE
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note right of NOC: HKN-003: Mengelola Kredensial SSH
        NOC->>FE: Input/Edit kredensial SSH<br/>(username, password)
        activate FE
        FE->>BE: POST /api/devices/{id}/credentials
        activate BE
        BE->>BE: Enkripsi kredensial
        BE->>DB: Save encrypted credentials
        activate DB
        deactivate DB
        FE-->>NOC: Kredensial berhasil disimpan
        deactivate BE
        deactivate FE
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note right of NOC: HKN-004: Mengelompokkan Perangkat per Mitra
        NOC->>FE: Pilih perangkat & assign mitra
        activate FE
        FE->>BE: PUT /api/devices/{id}/partner
        activate BE
        BE->>DB: Update relasi perangkat-mitra
        activate DB
        DB-->>BE: Konfirmasi update
        deactivate DB
        FE-->>NOC: Tampilkan grup per mitra
        deactivate BE
        deactivate FE
    end
